      <h1 class="belowfold__title belowfold__title--center">What is kratom?</h1>
      <p class="doc__lede">A leaf from <i>Mitragyna speciosa</i>, a Southeast Asian tree in the coffee family. Brewed and chewed there for centuries. Here’s the honest version, including the parts that aren’t flattering.</p>
