        <div class="testcard"><h3>Loose leaf powder</h3><p>Milled leaf, measured by the gram on a scale. Cheapest per gram, most control, most effort.</p></div>
        <div class="testcard"><h3>Extract capsules</h3><p>Concentrated and encapsulated, measured in milligrams. No taste, no prep.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="warnbar">These are <b>not interchangeable</b>. Grams of powder, a 35 mg gummy, and an extract capsule are different things, never convert one into another.</div>
    </section>

